		<section class="areaInfo">
			<h3 class="areaCatch">A beautiful area north of Mt. Rokko, blending nature, history, and hot springs</h3>
			<div class="areaText">
				<p>
					Arima Onsen is one of Japan’s three most famous hot springs. In a single thermal area, you can enjoy two very different spring waters: the bronze-colored kinsen (golden spring) containing iron and salt, and the ginsen (silver spring) which is colorless. A steamy tour of all seven springs is highly recommended. In addition to soaking in the hot springs, strolling through the historic town and hunting for souvenirs unique to Arima all add up to physical and mental refreshment and a great holiday.<br>
					Just north of Arima, find an excellent range of recreational spots and outlet malls amid verdant landscapes just right for family or couple’s outings.
				</p>
			</div>
			<figure class="areaPhoto"><img src="/lsc/asset/areaguide/area01-003.jpg" alt="Arima Onsen " width="100" height="100"></figure>
		</section>
