			</dl>
		</div>
		<section class="areaInfo">
			<h3 class="areaCatch">An essential destination to experience the beauty of Kobe</h3>
			<div class="areaText">
				<p>
					Meriken Park is a photogenic place indeed, dotted with unique structures like the Port Tower and the Kobe Maritime Museum, not to mention the BE KOBE sculpture commemorating the 150th anniversary of the opening of the port.<br>
					Over in Harborland we have the red brick warehouses and giant shopping mall, a place to enjoy the day with family or friends.<br>
					Beautiful ocean-blue views during the day turn to romantic night views later, especially from the top deck of the Port Tower or atop the Ferris wheel.<br>
					Stroll around on foot or board a cruise: Kansai’s prettiest bay area is to be enjoyed from every angle. 
				</p>
			</div>
			<figure class="areaPhoto"><img src="/lsc/asset/areaguide/area06-005.jpg" alt="Meriken Park" width="100" height="100"></figure>
		</section>
		<section class="areaSpot">
